        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>历史笔记 - 世界经济体系发展脉络</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", serif;\n    background: #f2f2ee;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f2f2ee;\n    padding: 25px 30px 25px 55px;\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 900px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .corner-mark {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 8px;\n    right: 15px;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    border: 2px solid #2e8b57;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    transform: rotate(10deg);\n  }\n  .timestamp {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 6px;\n    bottom: 40px;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    color: #999;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .entry {\n    display: flex;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .num {\n    flex: 0 0 30px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .num.circled {\n    display: inline-block;\n    color: red;\n    border: 2px solid red;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 20px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .year {\n    flex: 0 0 150px;\n  }\n  .desc {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .wrap-line {\n    margin-left: 200px;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-top: 22px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .plain-line {\n    margin-left: 30px;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"corner-mark\"></div>\n  <div class=\"timestamp\">20210728 23:57</div>\n\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num circled\">1</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">1918—1921</span>\n    <span class=\"desc\">战时共产主义政策（余粮收集制）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num circled\">2</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">1921—1927</span>\n    <span class=\"desc\">新经济政策（粮税，利用市场和商品货币关系发展生产）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num\">(3)</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">1928—1932</span>\n    <span class=\"desc\">第一个五年计划（优先发展重工业）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num\">(4)</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">1929—1937</span>\n    <span class=\"desc\">农业集体化（为保证国家工业化建设的顺利进行）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num\">(5)</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">1933—1937</span>\n    <span class=\"desc\">第二个五年计划（成为世界第二大工业强国）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num\">(6)</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">1991</span>\n    <span class=\"desc\">苏联解体，两极（冷战）格局瓦解 1947年杜鲁门主义冷战开始，马歇尔计划，1949年北约，</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"wrap-line\">1955年华沙条约美苏两极格局形成</div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">资本主义经济：</div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num\">(1)</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">1929—1933</span>\n    <span class=\"desc\">以美国为首的资本主义国家爆发经济大危机</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num\">(2)</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">20世纪30年代</span>\n    <span class=\"desc\">罗斯福新政，开创了资本主义国家干预经济发展的新模式</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num\">(3)</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">20世纪50年代—20世纪60年代末</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"wrap-line\">美国经济\"黄金时代\"（凯恩斯主义主导，政府运用经济手段对国民经济积极干预）</div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num\">(4)</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">20世纪70年代</span>\n    <span class=\"desc\">美国经济陷入\"滞胀\"（凯恩斯主义失灵）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num\">(5)</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">20世纪80年代</span>\n    <span class=\"desc\">美国经济回升（货币学派和供给学派）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num\">(6)</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">20世纪90年代</span>\n    <span class=\"desc\">\"新经济\"时代（\"宏观调控、微观自主\"，既反对完全自由放任，又反对过度的政</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"wrap-line\">府干预）</div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">全球化趋势：</div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num\">(1)</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">1944</span>\n    <span class=\"desc\">布雷顿森林体系（美元与黄金直接挂钩，是以美元为中心的资本</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"wrap-line\">主义世界货币体系）</div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num\">(2)</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">1945</span>\n    <span class=\"desc\">世界银行建立（WB）；国际货币基金组织成立（IMF）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num\">(3)</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">1948</span>\n    <span class=\"desc\">关税与贸易总协定</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num\">(4)</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">1967</span>\n    <span class=\"desc\">欧洲共同体成立（经济一体化）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num\">(5)</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">1993</span>\n    <span class=\"desc\">欧盟成立（经济政治一体化）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num\">(6)</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">1999</span>\n    <span class=\"desc\">欧元问世</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <span class=\"num\">(7)</span>\n    <span class=\"year\">1995</span>\n    <span class=\"desc\">\"关贸总协定\"发展为\"世界贸易组织\"（WTO）</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"plain-line\">1960年被称作非洲年</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
